.DS_Store

# Raw data + model artifacts — never commit; regenerate from committed code + seeds.
# House convention: raw rollouts/generations live in experiments/<phase>/raw/ (+ *.jsonl anywhere)
# and are IGNORED; derived metrics live in experiments/<phase>/results/*.json|csv and
# ARE committed (figures + paper numbers regenerate from them).
data/
outputs/
checkpoints/
adapters/
experiments/*/raw/
reproductions/*/raw/
*.parquet
*.jsonl
*.npy
*.npz
*.safetensors
wandb/
.modal/

# assay report cards are derived artifacts — regenerate from results/
reports/*.html

# secrets
.env
